    closingHeading: "Closing Thoughts",
    closingText: "Watching the PSAUX ransomware incident unfold was a stark reminder of why infrastructure hygiene matters. We spend so many hours writing clean UI components and backend queries, but without resilient backups and defensive servers, everything we build can disappear in a single command.",
    closing: "Protect your servers, test your offsite backups regularly, and never assume you are too small to be scanned!",
    closingSign: "Defending our servers with care,",
    signature: "Jill 🌸"
  },
  es: {
    title: "Querido Diario, Qué Es el Ransomware PSAUX y Cómo Cifra un Servidor Linux 🌸",
